      "comment" : "Button that tries again: on the menu's card after a problem (starting again), or under “Couldn’t resume” (resuming again; also on Settings → General's player card and in the alert that says why); in the alert that says why a supported media player couldn't be paused (pausing again) or controlled (starting again); under the step “Let AutoHush pause it” once AutoHush couldn't pause the web app itself; under Add an App's “Play something in %@” once the app didn't play in time",
